      "heading": "Condenser cleaning eligibility",
      "text": "Whirlpool directs owners to the model's manual before cleaning refrigerator condenser coils. Some models do not need condenser cleaning, while some require a certified technician. Dusty conditions or pets can change maintenance needs; do not impose one cleaning schedule on every refrigerator.",
