      "heading": "Water supply and filter checks",
      "text": "Low water pressure, a kinked supply line, or a clogged water filter can produce hollow cubes or stop ice production altogether. Confirm the household shutoff valve is fully open and replace overdue water filters before assuming the ice maker module or inlet valve has failed.",
