      "heading": "When to replace the water filter",
      "text": "Whirlpool recommends replacing refrigerator water filter cartridges approximately every six months, or sooner if water dispenser flow slows noticeably or ice develops off-tastes. Filter life varies with local water quality and usage volume.",
