      "heading": "Flushing air after replacement",
      "text": "After installing a new filter cartridge, dispense and discard several gallons of water in short intervals to purge trapped air and loose carbon fines from the lines. Failure to flush can cause sputtering at the dispenser or cloudy initial ice cubes.",
